The NIX application cores (sys/src/9/port/nix.c and the ac* parts of
the amd64 and arm64 kernels, execac(1), execac(2)), the zero-copy
I/O (sys/src/9/port/syszio.c, devzp.c, the zero-copy parts of
devsegment.c, libseg, zread(2), zp(2), zp(3), newseg(2)), semaphores and
tubes (sys/src/9/port/syssem.c, devtube.c, tube.h,
sys/src/libc/9sys/upsem.c, sys/src/libtube, sys/include/tube.h,
upsem(2), tsend(2), tube(3)), the performance counters
